From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:05:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] zeropi: enable SCP firmware (Crust)

Start Crust on the AR100 and route PSCI through it.
This adds deep suspend.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 configs/zeropi_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/zeropi_defconfig b/configs/zeropi_defconfig
index f28cefaf7c..4d78cb2a5c 100644
--- a/configs/zeropi_defconfig
+++ b/configs/zeropi_defconfig
@@ -10,3 +10,4 @@ CONFIG_CONSOLE_MUX=y
 CONFIG_SUN8I_EMAC=y
 CONFIG_USB_EHCI_HCD=y
 CONFIG_USB_OHCI_HCD=y
+CONFIG_SUNXI_SCPI_PSCI=y
